## Why This Is Asked
This question tests practical edge deployment, OTA rollout, and telemetry-driven governance for real-world industrial settings.

## Key Concepts
- SageMaker Edge Manager OTA workflow
- Canary and phased rollouts with rollback triggers
- Telemetry-driven monitoring (latency, errors, drift)
- Edge manifest versioning and cryptographic signing
- Cost governance and access control

## Code Example
```json
{
  "EdgeVersion": "v1.2.3",
  "ModelArtifactsS3Key": "s3://bucket/models/maintenance/v1.2.3/model.tar.gz",
  "SignKMSKeyId": "alias/edge-signing-key",
  "RolloutPlan": {
    "CanaryGroup": {
      "DeviceCount": 100,
      "MonitoringDuration": "24h",
      "ApprovalRequired": true
    },
    "Phases": [
      {
        "Name": "Phase1",
        "DevicePercentage": 10,
        "DeviceTypes": ["high-priority"]
      },
      {
        "Name": "Phase2", 
        "DevicePercentage": 30,
        "DeviceTypes": ["critical-infrastructure"]
      },
      {
        "Name": "Phase3",
        "DevicePercentage": 59,
        "DeviceTypes": ["standard"]
      }
    ]
  },
  "RollbackTriggers": {
    "AccuracyThreshold": 0.95,
    "LatencyThresholdMs": 200,
    "ErrorRateThreshold": 0.03,
    "MemoryThresholdPercent": 80
  }
}
```

## Why This Is Asked
This question tests practical use of SageMaker multi-model endpoints, per-tenant routing, and controlled releases under data privacy constraints (PrivateLink). It blends model choice, infrastructure sizing, and a measurable validation plan suitable for entry-level engineers.

## Key Concepts
- SageMaker multi-model endpoints and Model Registry
- Tenant-aware routing with API Gateway + Lambda
- PrivateLink data isolation and VPC considerations
- Canary rollouts and rollback criteria

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudocode for tenant routing to a variant
function routeTenant(req){
  const tenant = req.headers['x-tenant'];
  const variant = registry.getVariant(tenant);
  return endpoint.invoke({Body: req.body, Variant: variant});
}
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How would you test tenant isolation in practice?
- How would you monitor per-tenant drift and trigger rollbacks?
